sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(CLI / UI / DSP)
    participant Gatekeeper as Gatekeeper Interceptor<br/>AuthN: Bearer/SSO/Server
    participant ArgoServer as Argo Server<br/>2746/TCP HTTP+gRPC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as Workflow Controller<br/>6060/TCP (health)
    participant WorkflowPod as Workflow Pod<br/>(argoexec sidecar)
    participant Storage as Artifact Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure)

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Workflow Submission and API Access

    Client->>Gatekeeper: POST /api/v1/workflows<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / SSO OIDC
    Gatekeeper->>Gatekeeper: Validate token<br/>(client/server/sso mode)
    Gatekeeper->>ArgoServer: Forward authenticated request
    ArgoServer->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow CR<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>ArgoServer: Workflow created
    ArgoServer-->>Client: Workflow response (JSON/gRPC)

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: Workflow Orchestration

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Workflow CR watch event
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create workflow step Pod<br/>(with argoexec sidecar)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Pod created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodDisruptionBudget
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>(memoization cache)

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: Workflow Execution

    WorkflowPod->>WorkflowPod: argoexec: execute script
    WorkflowPod->>Storage: Upload output artifacts<br/>HTTPS
    Storage-->>WorkflowPod: Upload confirmed
    WorkflowPod->>K8sAPI: Update WorkflowTaskResult CR

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 4: Artifact Retrieval

    Client->>Gatekeeper: GET /artifacts/{namespace}/{workflow}/{node}/{artifact}
    Gatekeeper->>ArgoServer: Forward (authenticated)
    ArgoServer->>Storage: Fetch artifact
    Storage-->>ArgoServer: Artifact data
    ArgoServer-->>Client: Artifact response (HTTP)

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 5: Observability

    Client->>ArgoServer: GET /metrics<br/>(conditional auth via ARGO_SERVER_METRICS_AUTH)
    ArgoServer-->>Client: Prometheus metrics
    Client->>Controller: GET /healthz (port 6060)<br/>(no auth)
    Controller-->>Client: Health status
